>On the other paw, I realized something interesting.  The barbarian was
>carrying a lot of good stuff.  However, he dropped it right before he
>died.  What's more, the game left a bones level.  This means that all
>of his good stuff is stll there, and it isn't cursed!!  So, you want 
>your wizard to have good armor?  Save your game, and start a new one
>with a knight.  Get the knight to a lower level, drop all your stuff,
>and let someone kill you.  Once the wizard gets down there, he gets
>the stuff (assuming he can deal with the ghost).  Tourists can supply
